      "instance_name": "stand_your_ground_law",
      "label": "Stand Your Ground Law",
      "description": "A legal doctrine in some U.S. states that allows individuals to use force, including deadly force, in self-defense without a duty to retreat. The meme uses this legal concept ironically by pairing it with an absurd and racially charged phrase, highlighting the absurdity or potential misuse of the law in a satirical context.",
