      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the man in the mugshot pose, as the meme uses his image to embody the satirical juxtaposition of the 'stand your ground law' with the offensive phrase 'i said \"nibber get\"'. The user is implicitly identifying with or imagining themselves as the subject of the legal and racialized commentary presented in the meme.",
